    "id": "LOGIQA_dev_2472",
    "context": "If this reform measure is not welcomed by the cadres, we should revise it. If it is not popular with workers, we should adopt a new reform measure. And this measure must be either unpopular with cadres or workers.",
    "question": "Based on the above information, if the above statement is true, which of the followings must be true?",
