  {
    "id": "LOGIQA_dev_2659",
    "context": "In 2014, in order to welcome the APEC meeting, Beijing, Tianjin, Hebei and other places implemented the APEC governance model and adopted the strictest emission reduction measures in history. Sure enough, the intoxicating APEC basket appeared. However, with the end of the meeting, the APEC blue gradually disappeared. In this regard, some people expressed confusion, since the government can implement the APEC governance model in the short term to achieve good results, why not adhere to this model for a long time?",
    "question": "Based on the above information, except for which of the following, can all explain people's confusion?",
    "options": [
      "A) The most stringent emission reduction measures have created many practical difficulties that are difficult to solve in the process of implementation",
      "B) If the apec governance model is normalized in the near future, it will seriously affect the local economic and social development",
      "C) Any environmental governance needs to pay a price, and the key lies in whether the price paid exceeds the benefits",
      "D) If haze occurs frequently in beijing during the apec meeting, it will affect the image of our country"
    ],
    "answer": "D",
    "cot0shot.math teacher_input": "Please act as a math teacher and reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. Given a context and a question, explain your reasoning process and give the answer with the format \"\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C/D\".\n####\n# Context:\nIn 2014, in order to welcome the APEC meeting, Beijing, Tianjin, Hebei and other places implemented the APEC governance model and adopted the strictest emission reduction measures in history. Sure enough, the intoxicating APEC basket appeared. However, with the end of the meeting, the APEC blue gradually disappeared. In this regard, some people expressed confusion, since the government can implement the APEC governance model in the short term to achieve good results, why not adhere to this model for a long time?\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, except for which of the following, can all explain people's confusion?\n# Options:\nA) The most stringent emission reduction measures have created many practical difficulties that are difficult to solve in the process of implementation\nB) If the apec governance model is normalized in the near future, it will seriously affect the local economic and social development\nC) Any environmental governance needs to pay a price, and the key lies in whether the price paid exceeds the benefits\nD) If haze occurs frequently in beijing during the apec meeting, it will affect the image of our country\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:",
    "cot0shot.math teacher_output": "\n\nThe correct option is: C\n\nThe reasoning is that Pancake Man is described as having a broad knowledge base but not requiring a deep explanation, which aligns with Option C.\n\nThe correct option is: C",
