  {
    "id": "LOGIQA_dev_5534",
    "context": "Psychologists have found that, in general, students' attention varies with the time the teacher gives.At the beginning of the lecture, the student's attention will be greatly enhanced, and for a period of time in the middle to maintain a more ideal state. Then, the students' attention will begin to be distracted.",
    "question": "Based on the above information, which of the following options, if correct, best weakens the above conclusions?",
    "options": [
