  {
    "id": "LOGIQA_dev_6296",
    "context": "The public opinion image of entrepreneurs will have a direct impact on the companies they represent, and in corporate public opinion incidents, the words and actions of entrepreneurs will receive the most concentrated attention from the media and netizens. In response to corporate public opinion, a positive attitude is most helpful to alleviate negative public opinion. Entrepreneurs have generally performed well in response to public opinion, but there are also those who have responded improperly, resulting in an increase in negative public sentiment and damaging personal and corporate reputation.",
    "question": "Based on the above information, which one of the followings is the focus of the above sentence?",
    "options": [
      "A) Public opinion image of entrepreneurs",
      "B) Corporate public opinion events",
      "C) Corporates' response to public opinion",
      "D) Entrepreneurs' respond to public opinion"
