    "id": "LOGIQA_dev_4317",
    "context": "As the only South American team to stay in the World Cup, Brazil will face the England team that eliminated Denmark in the next game. Brazil coach Scolari is reluctant to talk about how to compete with England, and his players have also maintained Clear mind. After defeating the tenacious Belgian team, Scolari was relieved: The first thing I think about now is to relax.",
