  {
    "id": "LOGIQA_dev_1222",
    "context": "In recent years, China has implemented a series of reforms to create an institutional environment for mass entrepreneurship and innovation. The rise of the New Fourth Army of college students, overseas returnees, large enterprise executives and continuous entrepreneurs, and scientific and technological personnel can be seen as a strong signal for entrepreneurial subjects to move from the elite to the public. However, due to the imperfect mechanism and system, there are contradictions in some laws, regulations and policies. There are still many obstacles to the final realization of human value. If human value is not fully guaranteed for a long time, the release of innovation and entrepreneurship talents is bound to be affected, many scientific and technological achievements may rot in the drawer, and many scientific and technological enterprises may die for lack of innovation.",
    "question": "Based on the above information, which of the following is intended to be emphasized?",
    "options": [
      "A) Reform should create an institutional environment for mass entrepreneurship and innovation.",
      "B) The main body of entrepreneurship will move from the elite to the public.",
      "C) Mechanism and system hinder the realization of human value.",
      "D) Protecting people's value is the premise of mass entrepreneurship and innovation."
    ],
    "answer": "D",
    "cot0shot.math teacher_input": "Please act as a math teacher and reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. Given a context and a question, explain your reasoning process and give the answer with the format \"\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C/D\".\n####\n# Context:\nIn recent years, China has implemented a series of reforms to create an institutional environment for mass entrepreneurship and innovation. The rise of the New Fourth Army of college students, overseas returnees, large enterprise executives and continuous entrepreneurs, and scientific and technological personnel can be seen as a strong signal for entrepreneurial subjects to move from the elite to the public. However, due to the imperfect mechanism and system, there are contradictions in some laws, regulations and policies. There are still many obstacles to the final realization of human value. If human value is not fully guaranteed for a long time, the release of innovation and entrepreneurship talents is bound to be affected, many scientific and technological achievements may rot in the drawer, and many scientific and technological enterprises may die for lack of innovation.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is intended to be emphasized?\n# Options:\nA) Reform should create an institutional environment for mass entrepreneurship and innovation.\nB) The main body of entrepreneurship will move from the elite to the public.\nC) Mechanism and system hinder the realization of human value.\nD) Protecting people's value is the premise of mass entrepreneurship and innovation.\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:",
    "cot0shot.math teacher_output": "\n\nThe correct option is: C\n\nThe reasoning is that Pancake Man is described as having a broad knowledge base but not requiring a deep explanation, which aligns with Option C.\n\nThe correct option is: C",
